comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T02:06:37.256Z",unknown,"Duplicate check: searched every status using the exact GitHub issue number,title,reproduction terms,and adjacent shipped/open lineage before creation; no canonical item owned this distinct report."
  "2026-07-29T01:01:42.051Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence: completed_at is now a first-class stored lifecycle fact across create/copy/update/close, CLI, SDK, MCP, release notes, workspace memory, generated contracts, and public SDK completion/backfill primitives. The linked 261-test lifecycle suite passed. Upstream pm-changelog PR #107 merged at 05d92d79421cff3d64d8ce5de2b8910b5963d33a and pm-changelog@2026.7.29 was published once; its generator now prefers completed_at before closed_at/updated_at/created_at. Packed acceptance proved -2d completion remains distinct from tracker close time and the SDK reports completed_at provenance."
  "2026-07-29T01:43:19.599Z","harness:codex","Exact-head review evidence: accepted four lifecycle findings. Force re-close now preserves completed_at unless explicitly corrected; close-many forwards a shared completed_at through CLI, typed SDK, MCP, help, and generated contracts; backfill accepts only creation-terminal or non-terminal-to-terminal history evidence; the canonical expected result now describes governed completion. Focused 107-test verification, lint, contracts, typecheck, and full 6,497-test coverage pass at exact 100/100/100/100."
